# ==========================================================
# INTEGRATIONS
# ==========================================================
# Nothing in this repository is enabled by editing a template. Every
# integration with another service is rendered by a switch in .env:
#
#   CROWDSEC_BOUNCER_ENABLED=true        -> config/dynamic/crowdsec.yml
#                                            (threat-crowdsec, threat-crowdsec-appsec —
#                                            placed on the websecure entrypoint)
#   AUTHENTIK_FORWARD_AUTH_ENABLED=true  -> config/dynamic/authentik.yml
#                                            (auth-authentik — a router's auth position)
#
# Their templates are crowdsec.yml.tmpl and authentik.yml.tmpl beside this
# file. This file renders to an empty integrations.yml and stays so that a
# rendered config/ from before the switches keeps its file set.
# ==========================================================
